Based on my thorough review of all AXAML views, code-behind files, converters, Tokens.axaml, and localization infrastructure, I've identified the following reproducible defects:

[{"severity":"important","file":"VPNRouter.App/Views/MainWindow.axaml:713","issue":"Hardcoded English string Content=\"↓ Update\" on the update-notification download button — not routed through Strings.cs, so Russian-locale users see an English button","fix":"Add a localized getter (e.g. Strings.UpdateDownloadBtn => Ru ? \"↓ Обновить\" : \"↓ Update\") and bind Content=\"{Binding UpdateVm.DownloadButtonText}\" or a MainWindowViewModel L_ property."},{"severity":"important","file":"VPNRouter.App/Views/Pages/NetworkPage.axaml:1482","issue":"Read-mode rule rows use fixed ColumnDefinitions=\"20,70,140,*,Auto\" + ColumnSpacing=10 + Margin=\"14,1\" (minimum ~288 px) inside a detail pane that is only ~192 px at the 360 px MinWidth — Value column and delete button are clipped and unreachable","fix":"Add a narrow-mode DataTemplate for Read-view rows (stack action+type on row 1, value full-width on row 2, mirroring the Cards narrow pattern) gated on IsRulesNarrow, or reduce fixed column widths / drop the 140-px Type column to a tooltip at narrow."}]
